{"case_id": "miyazaki_male_19830421_P003-Q14", "domain": "relationship", "question": "命主的婚恋和子女情况？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字：年柱癸亥，月柱丙辰，日柱己卯，时柱丁卯。日主为己土，生于辰月，得月令之助，但地支两卯木克土，天干丙丁火生土，整体身偏弱但印星有力。男命以正财为妻星，八字中财星癸水透于年干，但被月干丙火合克，且日支卯木为七杀，婚姻宫坐杀，主婚恋中易有压力或波折。时柱丁卯，卯木为七杀，子女宫坐杀，子女缘分需看时柱天干丁火为偏印，印星化杀生身，暗示子女能带来福气，但过程有考验。\n\n大运方面，命主早年行乙卯、甲寅等木旺运，七杀强，感情上多不稳定。2011年辛卯年，辛金食神透出制杀，且卯木为日支伏吟，有婚动之象，但流年与日柱伏吟，主关系变化或结婚。2014年甲午年，甲木正官合日主，午火为印星，印星生身，且午为桃花，此年生育可能性大。综合看，婚恋虽有小波折，但2011年成婚，2014年得女，符合选项A的描述。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "miyazaki_male_19830421_P003-Q14", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_2_g1\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4017, "response_id": "eeeada3f-17f5-47b8-9081-50e40226a888", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 269, "completion_tokens": 310, "total_tokens": 579, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 256}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 256, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 13}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
